<title>FINLAND: POLAR SEES IMPROVING 1997 OPERATING PROFIT.</title>
<headline>POLAR SEES IMPROVING 1997 OPERATING PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group Polar-Yhtyma Oy said on Thursday it expected its operating profit to improve this year.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's operating earnings are expected to improve during the current financial year,&quot; Polar said in a statement with its calendar 1996 results.</p>
<p>Last year, Polar's operating profit rose to 54 million markka from 51 million.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
